# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Caddy in front of a self-hosted Someday (docs/self-hosting.md). Caddy gets
# and renews the TLS certificate automatically; HTTPS is required (passkeys
# and the __Host- session cookie only work over HTTPS).
#
# Replace the domain. Caddy appends the client address to X-Forwarded-For;
# Someday believes it only from addresses listed in TRUSTED_PROXIES.

someday.example.com {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}
